The upstream plugin declares `license: Private` and ships no licence file, so
this public repository does not redistribute its code. The image build fetches
the file from the pinned upstream commit with `ADD --checksum`, and the build
fails unless its bytes match the SHA-256 above (also in manifest.json and
SHA256SUMS). Nothing is downloaded at runtime.
